{%- comment -%} FitPatches — Как действа (4 стъпки) {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="fp-hw" id="fphw-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="fp-hw__wrap">
    <p class="fp-hw__eyebrow">КАК ДЕЙСТВА</p>
    <h2 class="fp-hw__title">Ето как FitPatches работи</h2>
    <div class="fp-hw__grid">
      <div class="fp-hw__step">
        <div class="fp-hw__media"><img class="fp-hw__img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0929/9545/files/fp-hw-hw1.png?v=1785878037" alt="Стъпка 1" loading="lazy"><span class="fp-hw__num">1</span></div>
        <h3>Залепи лепенката</h3>
        <p>Сутрин, върху чиста и суха кожа — ръка, корем или бедро.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-hw__step">
        <div class="fp-hw__media"><img class="fp-hw__img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0929/9545/files/fp-hw-hw2.png?v=1785878037" alt="Стъпка 2" loading="lazy"><span class="fp-hw__num">2</span></div>
        <h3>Носи я през деня</h3>
        <p>Тънка и дискретна — не се усеща под дрехите и не пречи.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-hw__step">
        <div class="fp-hw__media"><img class="fp-hw__img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0929/9545/files/fp-hw-hw3.png?v=1785878037" alt="Стъпка 3" loading="lazy"><span class="fp-hw__num">3</span></div>
        <h3>Апетитът намалява</h3>
        <p>Берберинът се усвоява постепенно през кожата и овладява глада.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fp-hw__step">
        <div class="fp-hw__media"><img class="fp-hw__img" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0929/9545/files/fp-hw-hw4_d73668a7-53ac-41a6-abd7-c546b2a39fea.png?v=1785878252" alt="Стъпка 4" loading="lazy"><span class="fp-hw__num">4</span></div>
        <h3>Виждаш резултат</h3>
        <p>Хапваш по-малко без насилие и фигурата ти се променя седмица след седмица.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  #fphw-{{ section.id }}{--a:#d64d87;--soft:#fbe9f1;--warm:#faf0f4}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__wrap{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 18px}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__eyebrow{text-align:center;color:var(--a);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:12px;margin:0 0 8px}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__title{text-align:center;font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#111;margin:0 0 32px}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__media{position:relative;margin-bottom:14px}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:16px;display:block}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__ph{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;border:2px dashed #e3b3ca;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#c98bab;background:var(--warm);text-align:center;font-size:13px}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__num{position:absolute;top:-10px;left:-10px;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:3px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__step h3{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#111;margin:0 0 6px}
  #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__step p{color:#666;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;margin:0}
  @media(max-width:749px){
    #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
    #fphw-{{ section.id }} .fp-hw__title{font-size:24px}
  }
</style>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "FitPatches Как работи", "tag": "section", "settings": [], "presets": [ { "name": "FitPatches Как работи" } ] }
{% endschema %}
